    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d386">

                <pb facs="0520" n="440" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg440"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Portugal to the
                            Vice-President of the United
                    States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I share with the American people in the mourning that so sorely afflicts
                    them.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">King of Portugal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
